Edit Simulation Properties
In the dialog box you can change the simulation properties of the object. The shared properties are
described under Dialog Items of the Objects.
Edit Animation Properties
To edit the 3D properties of the object in the dialog box Edit 3D Properties:
• Click the button 
  Edit 3D Properties in the lower left corner of the simulation properties dialog box.
• Select the object in the model and press the spacebar.
To manipulate the graphic of the object, click Show Manipulators on the Edit ribbon tab or press M on the
keyboard.
