Time Reference [Trigger]
Select the time reference which the Trigger uses during the simulation run.
Remarks
You can select one of these settings:
• Relative
Then type a point in time (time) into the text box Start Time [Trigger].
• Absolute
Then type a point in time on a certain date (dateTime) into the text box Start Date [Trigger].
