Trigger Type
Select the Trigger Type. They differ in the way in which they generate events.
Remarks
You can select one of these settings:
• Input Trigger takes the values from a single TimeSequence.
Click Values, and type the values into the Value Table of the TimeSequence.
• Combination generates a new Trigger by combining existing Triggers.
Click Combination Table and type in the names of the Triggers that are to be combined. Plant
Simulation saves the result of the combination in the combination list that clicking Values opens.
