Attributes [Trigger]
Click Attributes below Trigger and type in the names of the objects and the attributes, which the Trigger
controls into the list.
Remarks
First, click the check box 
  to turn Inheritance 
  off. Only then you can type data into the list.
Then proceed as follows:
• Type the name of the object that the Trigger controls into the column Object.
• Type the name of the attribute of this object as a string into the column Attribute.
For a Variable object, you do not have to type in an attribute. The Trigger then passes the current value
to the attributes of the respective objects.
• When an error occurs in the value assignment during the simulation run, Plant Simulation inserts the
respective error message in the column Error Message.
SimTalk
insertTriggeredAttr [SimTalk]
deleteTriggeredAttr [SimTalk]
See also
Context Menu of Embedded Lists
