Methods [Trigger]
Click Methods below Trigger to open a list.
Remarks
First, click the check box 
  to turn Inheritance 
  off.
Type in the names of the methods that the Trigger controls. This way, Plant Simulation can call a different
Method whenever a value of the Trigger changes. Plant Simulation passes the previous and current trigger
values as parameters when the methods are called.
SimTalk
insertTriggeredMeth [SimTalk]
deleteTriggeredMeth [SimTalk]
See also
Context Menu of Embedded Lists
