Objects [Trigger]
To open a list containing the Source that creates the parts, click this button.
Remarks
The list shows the name of and the path to the Source object which Plant Simulation inserted when you
selected Time of creation > Trigger in the dialog of the Source, clicked on Trigger, typed in the name of
the Trigger and clicked OK or Apply.
You cannot edit this table.
